# Generated build artifacts. POLICY: nothing produced by `bcc build` is tracked.
# The .bmod that IS reviewed lives under test_files/golden/bmod/ and is compared
# byte-for-byte by run_build_tests.sh — tracking a second, self-updating copy
# next to the sources would give the same file two sources of truth, and the
# tracked one would silently drift whenever a build ran.
*.ll
*.o
*.a
*.bmod
myapp/myapp
timerapp/timerapp
counterapp/counterapp
printapp/printapp
sizeapp/sizeapp
